        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>This lumbering tortoise is the size of a pony and its head features a powerful, razor-sharp beak.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 23, touch 7, flat-footed 23 (-2 dex, +16 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 57 [84] (6d10+24)</p><p>Fort +9, Ref +3, Will +2</p><p>Resist Earth 10</p><p>Weakness Ice</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 20 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +13 (1d8+10)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Abilities Shell</p><p>Special Attacks Breath Weapon (1d4+1 rounds, 30-ft. cone, DC 17, 4d6 water damage)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 24, Dex 6, Con 18, Int 2, Wis 10, Cha 6</p><p>Base Atk +6; CMB +13 (+15 vs. bull rush); CMD 21 (23 vs. bull rush; 25 vs. trip)</p><p>Feats Improved Bull Rush, Power Attack, Weapon Focus (bite)</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +9, Climb +17, Perception +12, Survival +10</p>"
